## 二、Activity 间传参

### 发送方：putExtra 装信封

```kotlin
val intent = Intent(this, DetailActivity::class.java).apply {
    putExtra("EXTRA_USER_ID", 42)          // Int
    putExtra("EXTRA_USER_NAME", "小明")     // String
}
startActivity(intent)
```

### 接收方：读信封

```kotlin
class DetailActivity : ComponentActivity() {
    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)
        // ⚠️ 空安全实战（Day 4）：getStringExtra 返回 String?
        val userId = intent.getIntExtra("EXTRA_USER_ID", -1)      // 第二参数是默认值
        val userName = intent.getStringExtra("EXTRA_USER_NAME") ?: "无名"

        setContent { DetailScreen(userId, userName) }
    }
}
```

### 常见隐式动作速查

| Action | 效果 |
|--------|------|
| `ACTION_VIEW` + http uri | 打开浏览器 |
| `ACTION_DIAL` + tel: uri | 拨号盘（不拨出） |
| `ACTION_SEND` | 分享 |
| `ACTION_SETTINGS` | 系统设置页 |

